			<div class="content" id="post-content-1703744">
									

<p><strong>Problem:</strong> There is a potential error in this SCP's terminology.</p>
<p><strong>Explanation:</strong> You mention, in the 'Stage 3' section that 'infected subjects display extreme hyperphagia'. The term I believe you intended to use is 'Polyphagia'. Both are conditions characterised by excessive hunger, however Hyperphagia is a subset of Polyphagia believed to occur due to damage or lesion on the Hyperthalmus, whereas Polyphagia is a more generalised term usually caused by metabolic pathobiologies. Unless the virus does indeed cause brain damage, in which case I recant this statement.</p>
<p><strong>Additional:</strong> I enjoyed this article.</p>

